%N A398357 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=0} (-1)^k * H(2*k+1) / (2*k+1)^2, where H(k) = A001008(k)/A002805(k) is the k-th harmonic number.
%H A398357 Ali Shadhar Olaikhan, <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/publication/373488370">An Introduction to the Harmonic Series and Logarithmic Integrals</a>, 2nd ed., 2023, section 4.5.2, p. 332, eq. (4.126).
%H A398357 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%F A398357 Equals Im(Li_3(1+i)) - Pi*log(2)^2/16 - log(2)*G/2, where i is the imaginary unit, and G is Catalan's constant (A006752).
%F A398357 Equals -Im(Li_3((1+i)/2)) + Pi*log(2)^2/32 - log(2)*G/2 + 7*Pi^3/128.
%e A398357 0.855297228659465737042095343875772691651264659859204...
%t A398357 RealDigits[Im[PolyLog[3, 1 + I]] - Pi*Log[2]^2/16 - Log[2]*Catalan/2, 10, 120][[1]]
%o A398357 (PARI) imag(polylog(3, 1 + I)) - Pi*log(2)^2/16 - log(2)*Catalan/2
